  "content": "<h1><strong>窗帘MOD (Curtain MOD)</strong> | <a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/blob/main/docs/README.CN.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">窗帘</a></h1><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/actions/workflows/build.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/actions/workflows/build.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"开发版本构建\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curtain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_845348_downloads.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge下载量\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurtain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">![Modrinth下载量](</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fmodrinth%252fdt%252fcurtain%253fcolor%253d00AF5C%2526label%253dModrinth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/curtain?color=00AF5C&amp;label=Modrinth</a> 下载量&amp;logo=modrinth) <a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">![GitHub下载量](</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fgithub%252fdownloads%252fGu-ZT%252fCurtain%252ftotal%253flabel%253dGithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Gu-ZT/Curtain/total?label=Github</a> 下载量&amp;logo=github)</p><h2>对于Minecraft 1.21+ NeoForge，您可以使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rolling-gate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RollingGate</a></h2><p>一个类似于 <a href=\"https://github.com/gnembon/fabric-carpet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">fabric-carpet</a> 的Forge模组</p><p>Curtain Mod是一个为Forge Minecraft开发的模组，让您能够完全掌控游戏技术层面的关键元素。</p><ul>\n<li>使用 <code>/log</code> 实时查看服务器怪物容量、TPS等数据更新</li>\n<li>使用 <code>/player</code> 控制/生成玩家</li>\n<li>……</li>\n</ul><h2>如何使用？该怎么做？</h2><ul>\n<li>按照此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforums.minecraftforge.net%252ftopic%252f89239-excessively-asked-questions-eaq%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a>中所有其他Forge模组的说明操作，将 <code>curtain...jar</code> 放入 <code>mods</code> 文件夹中，与其他兼容模组一起使用。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>/curtain</code> 命令打开Curtain的主菜单。<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/642/622/2023-04-02-223346.png\" alt=\"主菜单\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>点击彩色按钮来启用/禁用窗帘规则。</li>\n</ul><h2>Curtain Mod规则</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/blob/main/docs/RULES.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看此处</a></li>\n</ul><h2>基于以下项目开发</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gnembon/fabric-carpet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Carpet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/gugle-carpet-addition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GCA</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/plusls/plusls-carpet-addition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PCA</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TISUnion/Carpet-TIS-Addition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpet TIS Addition</a></li>\n</ul>",
